        "id": 212174,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-31T23:31:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Cult of Gloom wrote:</b><br><blockquote>... he must surely go though a lot of trouble to get those custom mix-matched suits. For someone who is often invisible, he sure does seem like he is trying to impress someone.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;\n<p>I think when he uses his powers, it changes the color of his clothes. He doesn't buy those suits, he makes them.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That was how I understood his power to work. Possibly, the suit replaces whatever he's wearing.</p>",
